ous sequence establishes\nthe starting situation:\n\nRiven is on the ground after the violent impact.\nHer sword has been broken.\n\nMaintain natural visual continuity with this situation.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\n16:9 cinematic live-action dark fantasy.\n\nBurning village at dusk.\n\nGrounded realistic movement.\n\nNatural English dialogue and lip sync.\n\nSlow, restrained cinematic camera movement.\n\nSmoke, drifting ash, embers, and distant firelight.\n\nKeep the scene intimate and emotionally restrained.\n\nNo combat.\n\nNo subtitles.\n\nNo background music.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nBegin close to the broken piece of Riven's sword\nlying in the dirt.\n\nRiven is visible behind it,\nstill on the ground and badly exhausted.\n\n\nFor a moment, she barely moves.\n\nThe mysterious attacker is no longer visible.\n\nOnly distant fire,\nburning wood,\nand Riven's exhausted breathing can be heard.\n\n\nThen—\n\na faint cough is heard somewhere deeper\ninside the ruined village.\n\n\nRiven reacts.\n\nShe slowly raises her head.\n\n\nAnother weak cough.\n\n\nRiven recognizes something familiar in the sound.\n\nVery quietly, almost afraid of the answer, she says:\n\n\"Father...?\"\n\n\nNo clear response.\n\n\nRiven forces herself to move.\n\n\nShe reaches for the remaining broken section\nof her sword and takes it with her.\n\n\nRiven struggles back onto her feet.\n\nShe is extremely exhausted\nand initially has difficulty maintaining her balance.\n\nAfter recovering,\nshe slowly follows the direction of the sound.\n\n\nThe camera follows Riven through the smoke.\n\nShe moves between damaged wooden structures\nand burning debris.\n\nShe is no longer running.\n\nEvery step is difficult.\n\n\nRiven searches ahead through the smoke.\n\nThen she hears another weak sound nearby.\n\n\nShe stops.\n\n\nRiven turns toward the sound.\n\n\nThrough the smoke and debris ahead,\nshe finally sees her father lying on the ground\nnear the remains of a damaged building.\n\n\nDo not begin the conversation yet.\n\n\nRiven freezes for a moment.\n\nHer expression changes immediately.\n\n\nThen she rushes toward him.\n\n\nRiven drops to her knees beside her father.\n\n\nShe reaches toward him and urgently says:\n\n\"Father!\"\n\n\nHer father is severely weakened,\nbut still alive.\n\n\nHe slowly opens his eyes.\n\nHe recognizes Riven.\n\n\nEnd on Riven kneeling beside him,\nholding the broken remains of her sword nearby.\n\n\nCUT.、16:9", "ref_objects": [{"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/261ee32b51404e899bd2e742f8063e1f.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/6aa50d2c77bb40f4b7a8a760cb3ed555.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/1b6b141198054deaabf40bb5d8a01988.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}, {"object_type": 1, "image": {"uri": "tos-mya-i-uo7y4d541q/f05daf8006734b2d9e0512be85047425.png", "key": "", "request_id": "", "gender": 0}}], "result": {"object_type": 2, "video": {"vid": "v186a3gm000cdase73vog65n717j7fq0", "download_url": "http://v16-dola.dola.com/2c4ddd3bb6e0359c6d917bc14f4e9d6c/7d84e6c8/video/tos/mya/tos-mya-ve-50851/ocf84PHYCQAi4z4O3oBvs1E6XICHN4GRHi016E/", "duration": 30.079999923706055, "video_type": "mp4", "video_model": {"status": 10, "message": "success", "enable_ssl": true, "auto_definition": "360p", "enable_adaptive": false, "video_id": "v186a3gm000cdase73vog65n717j7fq0", "video_duration": 30.08, "media_type": "video", "url_expire": 2105861832, "fallback_api": "https://vod-urls-mya.byteintlapi.com/video/fplay/1/84be5825474248534a18caa2adc4f006/v186a3gm000cdase73vog65n717j7fq0", "video_list": {"video_1": {"definition": "1080p", "quality": "normal", "vtype": "mp4", "vwidth": 1280, "vheight": 720, "bitrate": 799370, "real_bitrate": 799370, "fps": 24, "codec_type": "bytevc1", "size": 3005633, "main_url": "", "backup_url_1": "", "file_id": "3da07feb674f4014b4cfd6fb6403ac03